The prompt gate's `xcodebuild -scheme TeslaSync ... build test` (iOS + macOS) is
DEFERRED to the signed CI runner. It is NOT reported green and was NOT run to a
zero exit. The blocker is PRE-EXISTING and OUT OF THE ALLOWED SCOPE:

